{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Clutch Drop》是一款講求時機與平衡的一指堆疊遊戲，玩家要操控吊臂把各款汽車精準放下，疊出愈來愈高的車塔；適合喜歡物理挑戰與高分競賽的玩家。原價 US $3.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-257.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>真實物理疊車挑戰</h2>\n<p>遊戲採用真實堆疊物理，每輛車都會壓在下一輛車上，偏移會令車塔傾斜，忽略傾斜便可能整座倒塌。玩家要抓準時機取得 Perfect 連擊，並在無盡計分模式中面對風勢、冰雪、低重力與隕石等變化；收錄 16 個世界、160 個關卡與 29 種車款，亦支援離線遊玩。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-318-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-319-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-320-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-321-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-322-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-323-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Clutch Drop</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/clutch-drop/id6826918866\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:24:16.662929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T20:16:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:36.059803+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:17:46.743940+00:00","content_hash":"ce65db13cdcd9727c8191de34428532e56503b7013bacd1023433bb3315fa12b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}